    <li>colonists(colonistsToLendCount>1)->colonists</li>
    <li>minAgeOrOlder(minAge==0)-></li>
    <li>minAgeOrOlder(minAge>0)-> [minAge] years old or older</li>
    <li>pawnListHaveConjugation(colonistsToLendCount==1)->has</li>
    <li>pawnListHaveConjugation(colonistsToLendCount>1)->have</li>
  -->
  <PawnLend.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>&lt;li&gt;questDescription (asker_factionLeader=True)-&gt;[asker_faction_leaderTitle] [asker_nameFull] de [asker_faction_name] precisa de mãos extras para ajudar [dutyDescription].\n\n[asker_pronoun] está pedindo para você emprestar [asker_objective] [colonistCountToLend] para [lendForDays] dias.\n\n[willSendShuttle]&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;disease-&gt;flu&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;disease-&gt;plague&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;disease-&gt;malaria&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;disease-&gt;infecção&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;questDescription(asker_royalInCurrentFaction==True)-&gt;[asker_royalTitleInCurrentFaction] [asker_nameFull] de [asker_faction_name] precisa de pessoas para ajudar [dutyRoyalDescription].\n\n[asker_pronoun] está pedindo para você emprestar [colonistCountToLend] para servir [asker_objective] para [lendForDays] dias.\n\n[willSendShuttle]&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;colonistCountToLend(colonistasToLendCount=1)-&gt;1 colonist[minAgeOrOlder]&lt;/li&gt;1&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;colonistaCountToLend(colonistasToLendCount&gt;1)-&gt;[colonistasToLendCount] colonistas[minAgeOrOlder]&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;willSendShuttle-&gt;[asker_pronoun] vai enviar um vaivém para pegar os [colonistas].&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;colonistas (colonistasToLendCount=1)-&gt;colonista&lt;/li&gt;colonistas\n&lt;li&gt;colonistas(colonistasToLendCount&gt;1)-&gt;colonistas&lt;/li&gt;colonistas\n&lt;li&gt;minAgeOrOlder(minAge=0)-&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;minAgeOrOlder(minAge&gt;0)-&gt; [minAge] anos de idade ou mais velho&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;pawnListHaveConjugation(colonistsToLendCount==1)-&gt;has&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;pawnListHaveConjugation (colonistsToLendCount&gt;1)-&gt;have&lt;/li&gt;\n</PawnLend.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
